            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2461] Masking Jetty Server version with User-configurable parameter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2461</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Security conscious organisations does not want to reveal the Application Server name and version to prevent Script-kiddies from finding the information easily when fingerprinting the Application. The exact version number can tell an Attacker if the current Application Server is patched for or vulnerable to certain publicly known CVE associated to it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;All&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
